              "content": "Returns a paginated list of activities with optional filtering.\n\nAdditional fields can be included in the response using the `embed` parameter. Available embed options:\n- `shopper` - Shopper object associated with the activity\n\nMultiple embed options can be specified as a comma-separated list, e.g., `embed=shopper`.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
